    "catalog:format": "2",
    "catalog:tags": "bidet, bathroom",
    "catalog:note": "Floor-standing back-to-wall bidet in format v2. rim 0.40. The rim and bowl are an oval pan 0.37 wide with a round bowl of radius 0.13, drawn as one outline sweep of true arcs to the wall less a round one, round a bowl floor set 0.01 into it (overlap bowl+bowl-floor), on a pedestal of the same oval set 0.03 in. The waste port is on the floor under the pedestal; the trap is inside it, not drawn. A pillar mixer 0.08 high on the rear deck makes the overall height 0.48; it builds as a prism.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Drafting standard key dimensions (practice, verify; EN 14528 for bidets), not read, unverified: bidet 0.37 x 0.56 x 0.40. The oval, bowl and pedestal sizes are the author's. Ports BS EN 12056-2 via the drafting standard, not read, unverified",
    "ifc:class": "IfcSanitaryTerminal",
    "ifc:predefinedType": "BIDET",
    "ifcClass": "IfcSanitaryTerminal",
    "mat:bowl": "ceramic",
    "mat:bowl-floor": "ceramic",
    "mat:pedestal": "ceramic",
    "mat:tap": "metal"
  },
